<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for contacting us about your flight to {!Case.Arrival_City__c}.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We want all our customers to have a comfortable and pleasant journey when they travel with us, so we regret your enjoyment of the flight was affected by the poor behaviour of nearby children/another passenger.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If due to noisy children add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">To assist parents in-flight, we offer children’s packs, child meals and bassinets for babies. While I understand how frustrating this situation was for you, we do rely on parents to ensure that their children do not disturb other passengers. </font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Our crew have to be sensitive in dealing with this type of situation. Your comments about the way this matter was handled on board your flight, have already been passed onto our Cabin Crew management and will be used in future reviews of our processes.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If questioning outcome for disruptive customer add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We are unable to advise you of the outcome of {details of what happened} due to privacy regulations.&nbsp;</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We appreciate you taking the time to advise us of your experience and hope we can make you more comfortable next time you travel with us.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><p style=""><span style="color: white; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: small; text-align: center;"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color: white; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: small; text-align: center;"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color: white; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: small; text-align: center;">{!Case.Thread_Token}</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>